export anchor SREMinimalStyle:
    number: 308
    screen: OpsMonitor
    name: SRE minimal
    idea: A very quiet single column in neutral greys, a plain sentence of the state at the top, hairline lists and tiny grey charts, with colour used only for the open incident.
    base: dark
    palette:
        ground: #131416, the page and style sheet
        ink: #dcdcdc, text and the primary button
        soft: #b5b5b5, values and secondary text
        muted: #8f8f8f, labels, times and healthy status
        hairline: #2a2b2e, row rules and chart baselines
        mark: #7d7d7d, chart lines
        incident: #ff8466, the open incident, Degraded, Firing and the error spike only
        focus: #e8e8e8, a thin focus outline
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial, at 15px and 1.6. The summary sentence is 34px at 300, the
        incident title 20px at 500, names 15px at 500, labels, times and
        status lines 13px in muted grey.
    layout:
        One left aligned column of about 760px with wide margins. A small
        muted header line reads Brightwork Ops production 24 h with the
        apps as plain links at right. A muted description line leads to a
        large light sentence, One incident open in the incident colour,
        then three services healthy, sync-worker degraded and billing back
        after six minutes. The incident follows with a 2px incident colour
        left line, its number, Investigating and Severity 2 in small
        incident text, the title and the opened time and owner. Services,
        the charts, alerts and deploys follow as quiet sections with small
        muted headings and 64px between them. Lists are hairline rows with
        the name, a right aligned value and a status line below. The charts
        are three small grey line charts side by side with captions, the
        error spike marked by a small incident diamond. At phone width the
        charts stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px rows, 64 to 72px between sections, 48px page padding.
    density: Sparse. One narrow column.
    corners: None, 2px on buttons.
    borders: 1px #2a2b2e hairlines between rows, a 2px incident line, an underline field.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        14px status shapes in grey beside lower case words, a ringed tick
        for healthy, a circular arrow for recovered and a tick for
        resolved. Only the triangle for degraded, the bolt for firing and
        the magnifier for investigating take the incident colour.
    focus: A 1px light grey outline offset 4px.
    tone: Lower case and plain, such as healthy, degraded and resolved, led by a summary sentence.
